  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[支援版本]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; mc 1.19.2 <span style=\"font-size:14px\">（舊版）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; mc 1.19.4 <span style=\"font-size:14px\">（舊版）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; mc 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[需求模組]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; Player Animator 模組</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator</a>)</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[新增物品]</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">=&gt; 模板</strong></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">=&gt; 悟空套裝</strong></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">=&gt; 悟空法杖</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/780/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"272\" height=\"176\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[合成配方]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/781/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"332\" height=\"155\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/782/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"332\" height=\"161\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[視覺效果]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/783/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"495\" height=\"316\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[物品提示]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/784/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"499\" height=\"186\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[技能 1]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>猛擊右鍵點擊的目標，造成 10(+ 目標最大生命值 12%) 點傷害。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/787/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"501\" height=\"521\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[技能 2]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>使周圍實體浮空，並造成 8(+ 克死等級) 點傷害。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/786/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"492\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/785/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"492\" height=\"246\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[設定選項]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/788/capture.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"226\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[相容模組]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; Better Combat 模組</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; Epic Fight 模組（+ Weapons of Miracles 模組）</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[不相容模組</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; OptiFine 模組</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
